To address the client's requirement for reducing processing time, we can leverage our quantisation methods, including INT8, INT4 (GPTQ), and GGUF, to optimize the performance of the AI model without compromising its accuracy. This will ensure that the system provides timely responses compatible with daily use by agents.

Lastly, considering our typical retrieval precision at 5 (0.87) and typical answer relevance score (0.84), along with a low hallucination rate (2.1%), we are confident that our designed solution will meet the client's performance benchmarks while ensuring the quality and relevance of the information provided to agents.

